# Open this file in Rider, Visual Studio or VS Code (REST Client extension)
# and click "Send request" above each call.
@api = http://localhost:8080

### Health: API + database + PostGIS version
GET {{api}}/api/health

### All places
GET {{api}}/api/places

### Places within 50 km of Novi Sad
GET {{api}}/api/places/nearby?lat=45.2671&lng=19.8335&radiusKm=50

### One place
GET {{api}}/api/places/1

### Create a place
POST {{api}}/api/places
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Palić Lake",
  "category": "Nature",
  "region": "North Bačka",
  "description": "Lake resort near Subotica with Art Nouveau villas.",
  "latitude": 46.1017,
  "longitude": 19.7614
}
